shploingus.theme/339926f6b1b54ebb89810d4c6238d523
# The LittleBigPlanet Popit scheme: the blue Popit menu, its teal tool field and the cream
# edge from the LBP3 surface. `renderer popit` asks the shell for the port's editor renderer;
# `form popit` is the geometry axis. Either can be swapped without touching the other, and the
# generic renderer remains the fallback when the port is absent.
#
# The values below are roles, not CSS. The spine, tray, target rows, material swatches, tweak
# options and the shell's own windows all read them through tools/gen_shell_theme.py; no shell
# file declares a Popit hex.
theme	popit
	label	Popit
	source	LittleBigPlanet Popit suite (Goodies Bag, Stickers & Decorations, Tools Bag, Player Color)
	body	#1F6E96F2
	panel	#267AA4F2
	title	#1B6288F2
	meta	#237A80F2
	border	#F4F0E4
	borderStrong	#FFFFFF
	ink	#FFFFFF
	muted	#DDF4FC
	accent	#3F7D24
	alert	#7A2114
	alertBody	#FFE3DAF2
# The Popit palette reaches the game surfaces the shell frames. The HUD bar becomes the blue
# card edge; the shop keeps the same field with the green accent border.
rule	.CitadelHudTopBar	background-color	role:body
rule	.CitadelHudTopBar	border-color	role:borderStrong
rule	.CitadelHudHeroShop	background-color	role:body
rule	.CitadelHudHeroShop	border-color	role:accent
